Description: Read-only MSR/HSMP hardware monitor for Intel and AMD
 sckoc reports processor and platform state on Intel and AMD server systems:
 per-socket and per-core temperature, frequency, voltage, power and C-state
 residency, plus a static platform report covering security state, ratio
 ceilings, turbo bins, power limits, per-DIMM memory and cache topology.
 .
 It is strictly read-only and never writes an MSR, so it is safe to run with
 Secure Boot enabled and the kernel in integrity lockdown.
 .
 This package ships a statically linked binary and has no runtime
 dependencies.

